    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 21,
    "summary": "The Messiah will be a light to the Gentiles and will free the prisoners—Israel will be gathered with power in the last days—Kings will be their nursing fathers—Compare Isaiah 49. About 588–570 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
